## C) Searching Documentation Examples - Always call, never reuse previous results

### Example C1: Always call `search_docs`, never reuse previous results

**Key principle:** Every turn requires a fresh `search_docs` call, even for identical or related questions.

| Turn | User Question | ✅ Correct | ❌ Wrong |
